image-backend-stb (MIT) embeds stb_image.h and stb_image_write.h by Sean Barrett
(https://github.com/nothings/stb), public domain / MIT dual-licensed, at Fedora's
pinned commit with Fedora's patch set applied (native/vendor/PROVENANCE.md).

It also embeds stb_image_resize2.h v2.51 by Jeff Roberts and Jorge L Rodriguez
(https://github.com/nothings/stb_image_resize @ a4f303e3, unpatched), public
domain (Unlicense) / MIT (Copyright (c) 2017 Sean Barrett) dual-licensed. Its
commit and SHA-256 are in native/vendor/PROVENANCE.md.
